    {
      "id": "claim_756c710892694fb6bee06076bfa45ef0",
      "statement": "Per-provisioner SAN defaults when the caller supplies none: AWS uses the private IP and ip-<ip>.<region>.compute.internal plus the subject unless DisableCustomSANs; GCP uses <name>.c.<project>.internal and <name>.<zone>.c.<project>.internal; Azure uses the parsed resource name; K8sSA takes the subject from the command line because the token is multi-use; the default takes the subject from the token.",
