    {
      "id": "claim_507bd046aceb4d5493d990848fe9c99c",
      "statement": "OIDC SAN semantics (documented inline): if the subject matches the token email, CN becomes the token subject with SANs email and iss#sub URI; if the subject does not match, CN = subject with splitSANs(subject); if --san values are provided, CN = subject with splitSANs(sans).",
