      "id": "claim_615dd9cfd11345fbaf33b8e7c134caa3",
      "statement": "step ca sign is the bring-your-own-CSR variant: it reads and signature-checks the CSR, threads it via WithCertificateRequest so the token is bound to the CSR through the cnf fingerprint claim, defaults SANs to the union of --san and the CSR's own SANs (mergeSans), and reroutes ACME to ACMESignCSRFlow.",
